---
name: time_left
version: 1
permission: web
params:
  type: object
  properties: {}
examples:
  - {}
---
Check how much of your hour tonight is left. Returns the current time and the minutes
remaining before your hour ends. Use it to pace yourself — you have the whole hour, so
there is no need to hurry, but do not let it run out with your files half-updated. It
reads your own local clock, so the number is honest even when the platform's time is not.
